  dialogueText: 'Hey! Here''s an interesting one.

    In Ilokano, ''agbalin'' means
    ''become.''

    It describes a change from one state or condition into another.

    For
    example, with practice, you can become more confident in speaking Ilokano.

    Now,
    try saying ''agbalin'' yourself.'
